1. Download & Install Git in windows/Mac
2. Open Terminal 
  -git --version
3. Set your Email & username if not set 
 -run the git config --list command and look for the user.name and user. email fields in the output.
 -To set 
 -git config --global user.name " your username "
 -git config --global user.email " your emailid "
 -To check which email is set git config --global user.email
4. Suppose You want to change these
  -git config --global --edit
5. Create Folder Using Git 
 -cd c 
 -mkdir LetsLearnGit
 -cd LetsLearnGit
 -git init (Now this folder is become repository & git initialized)
 -Check what we have in this folder 
 -ls
 -ls -a
 * a .git will now visible 
6. Now Add some files create some project / Fill that Folder 
